  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA activities in Gaza and the West Bank, 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meeting the objectives of UNRWA&#x2019;s flash appeal dated May 19, 2021, following hostilities in Gaza and mounting tensions in the West Bank, pointing to the need for US$ 38 million in connection with an initial 30-day response.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This un-earmarked funding contributes to meeting the objectives of UNRWA&#x2019;s flash appeal dated May 19, 2021, following hostilities in Gaza and mounting tensions in the West Bank, pointing to the need for US$ 38 million in connection with an initial 30-day response.

Due to its nature as a response to a humanitarian appeal operational results are general and highly aggregated and the MFA contribution is thus reflected in the overall results reporting by the partner.  Please refer to the hyperlink below.

https://www.unrwa.org/resources/emergency-appeals</narrative>
  </description>
